{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_171_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年，春，王正月，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"二、邾庶其以漆、閭丘來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。來奔者不言出，舉其接我者也。漆、閭丘不言及，小大敵也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"三、夏，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉欒盈出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"五、九月，庚戌，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，庚辰，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"七、曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"八、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子於商任。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_171_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_171","textTraditional":"九、庚子，孔子生。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}